    "hoitytoity": {
      "word": "HOITY-TOITY",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "Thoughtless; giddy; flighty; also, haughty; patronizing; as, to be in hoity-toity spirits, or to assume hoity-toity airs; used also as an exclamation, denoting surprise or disapprobation, with some degree of contempt. Hoity-toity! What have I to do with dreams Congreve.",
